## 2. Third-Party Assets — "Stella Sora" / 第三方素材 — 《星塔旅人》

Images, audio, and other assets under `SlayTheStella/images/` and
`SlayTheStella/audios/` are taken from *Stella Sora* (ステラソラ) by
Yostar, Inc., and remain the property of Yostar, Inc. They are used under
Yostar's fan-creation guidelines:

https://stellasora.jp/agreement

Key points: individuals and non-corporate groups may freely create and
distribute derivative works for non-profit purposes; modest income up to
the amount of production costs (materials, tools, utilities, etc.) is
considered within the non-profit scope. The guidelines may change without
notice, and the official text prevails.

This LICENSE does not re-license those assets to anyone.

`SlayTheStella/images/` 与 `SlayTheStella/audios/` 下的图像、音频等素材取自
悠星公司（Yostar, Inc.）的《星塔旅人》（ステラソラ），版权仍归悠星公司所有。
素材依悠星官方二次创作指南使用：

https://stellasora.jp/agreement

要点：个人或非法人团体在非营利目的下可自由制作、分发二创作品；覆盖制作
成本（原材料、工具、水电等费用）程度内的收益视为非营利范围。指南可能无
预告变更，以官方原文为准。

本 LICENSE 不构成对上述素材的再授权。

