## 3. Distribution — "Slay the Spire 2" Mod Terms / 分发条款 — 《杀戮尖塔2》Mod 条款

This repository is a mod for *Slay the Spire 2* by Mega Crit Games. Per the
Mega Crit content policy:

https://www.megacrit.com/content-policy/

- This mod is free to download; donations are welcome, but no other
  monetization is permitted, including paywalls or stretch-goal-based
  fundraising (whether for profit or charity).
- This mod is not officially affiliated with, or endorsed by, Mega Crit.

本仓库是 Mega Crit Games《杀戮尖塔2》的 mod。依 Mega Crit 内容政策：

https://www.megacrit.com/content-policy/

- 本 mod 免费下载；欢迎捐赠，但不得以其他方式变现，包括付费墙或
  stretch-goal 形式的众筹（无论盈利或慈善）。
- 本 mod 并非 Mega Crit 官方关联或背书。

