## 4. Not Covered by This License / 本许可未涵盖的内容

- Git submodules under `_manual/` (the STS2 modding tutorials and
  `STS2-RitsuLib`) are governed by the licenses of their own repositories.
  `_manual/` 下的 git 子模块（STS2 mod 教程、`STS2-RitsuLib`）以其各自仓库的
  许可为准。
- `sts2.dll` and `0Harmony.dll` are referenced from the game installation at
  build time and are not redistributed by this repository.
  `sts2.dll` 与 `0Harmony.dll` 在构建时引用自游戏安装目录，本仓库不分发它们。
